      "help_en": "The beginning of the time range to query.\n\nSpecify the time in the ISO 8601 standard in the yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ssZ format. The time must be in UTC.\n\nIf you leave this parameter empty, data within the previous day is queried",
      "help_zh": "获取数据起始时间点。\n\n日期格式按照ISO8601表示法，并使用UTC时间，格式为yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ssZ。\n\n如果不指定StartTime，默认读取前一天的数据",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "start_time",
      "options": [
        "--start-time"
      ],
      "raw_name": "StartTime",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "2018-10-03T20:00:00Z",
      "help_en": "The end of the time range to query.\n\nSpecify the time in the ISO 8601 standard in the yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ssZ format. The time must be in UTC.\n\nThe end time must be later than the start time. The duration between the end time and the start time cannot exceed seven days",
      "help_zh": "获取数据结束时间点。\n\n日期格式按照ISO8601表示法，并使用UTC时间，格式为yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ssZ。\n\n结束时间需大于起始时间，并且结束时间和开始时间相差不超过7天",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "end_time",
      "options": [
        "--end-time"
      ],
      "raw_name": "EndTime",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "pv",
